# Gateway skills live here, one directory per skill:
#   skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md          required
#   skills/<skill-name>/references/*.md   sub-topic docs, loaded on demand
#   skills/<skill-name>/assets/           distilled, sanitized exemplar code
#   skills/<skill-name>/scripts/          optional executable helpers
# Empty in v0.1.0. Built in S7-S8.
